        "content": "## Day 17 Solution: Variables, Expressions, and Parameters\n\nA 6-stage Set-node chain demonstrating string, date, math, and ternary expressions, ending in one interpolated report string. Credentials needed: None needed — all expressions run inside n8n's own engine.\n\nSee DAILY_TASKS/DAY_17_Variables_Expressions_Parameters.md.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 480
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "trigger1",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
